    topicKey: "condition-inspection",
    notes: "K.S.A. 58-2548. No CO/WY analog required this as a statutory obligation with a fixed 5-day deadline and mandatory tenant copy — genuine Kansas-specific gap, surfaced during the whole-library audit rather than the original section-by-section KRLTA pass (58-2548 was skipped in that pass).",
